OL,3,GNEWSAJunctions plan to target traffic
OL,4,A'pinch points'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull City Council has outlined plans to
OL,7,Ftackle congestion at two traffic "pinch
OL,8,Fpoints".
OL,10,FThe Roebank roundabout, on Kingswood,
OL,11,Fand the junctions at both ends of
OL,12,FCalvert Lane are set to be improved to
OL,13,Fcope with an anticipated increase in
OL,14,Ftraffic volumes in the future.
OL,16,FThe authority has launched a six-week
OL,17,Fconsultation on proposed changes.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
