OL,3,GNEWSAJunctions plan to target traffic
OL,4,A'pinch points'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mark Ieronimo, cabinet
OL,7,Fportfolio holder for transport and
OL,8,Finfrastructure, said: "As Hull
OL,9,Fcontinues to grow, it is important that
OL,10,Fwe plan ahead and invest in our road
OL,11,Fnetwork to meet future demand, rather
OL,12,Fthan simply waiting for problems to get
OL,13,Fworse."
